# 형상 템플릿 — 발행 시점 형상이다(운영자 실값 ✗). 키는 항상 남는다: 키를 지우면 수신자는 그 변수의
# 존재 자체를 모른다(2026-09-06 · 멀티 클러스터 5변수가 그렇게 빠졌다).
# 값의 정본 = 자기 manifest → `render_dockerfile.py --nccl-envfile --manifest output/<t>/manifest.yaml` 로 다시 파생한다.
# 층 규칙: render_dockerfile.env_tier (①env=치환 · ②preset·③invariant=값 유지 — 재현 사실(mtime ≤ 측정 2026-09-29T05:52:10Z 확인))
# 파생 키 interconnect.nccl_transport → NCCL_IB_DISABLE · NCCL_NET — 키마다 자기 자리표시 `<derived:interconnect.nccl_transport→<KEY>>` · 실효값 규칙: rdma → NCCL_IB_DISABLE=0 · NCCL_NET=IB | socket → NCCL_IB_DISABLE=1 · NCCL_NET=Socket
# 파생 키 interconnect.socket_iface → GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME · NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME · OMPI_MCA_btl_tcp_if_include · TP_SOCKET_IFNAME · UCX_NET_DEVICES — 키마다 자기 자리표시 `<derived:interconnect.socket_iface→<KEY>>` · 실효값 규칙: GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME={interconnect.socket_iface} · NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME={interconnect.socket_iface} · OMPI_MCA_btl_tcp_if_include={interconnect.socket_iface} · TP_SOCKET_IFNAME={interconnect.socket_iface} · UCX_NET_DEVICES={interconnect.socket_iface}
GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME=<derived:interconnect.socket_iface→GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME>    # tier=env
NCCL_CROSS_NIC=1    # tier=preset
NCCL_DEBUG=INFO    # tier=invariant
NCCL_DEBUG_SUBSYS=INIT,NET,GRAPH,ENV    # tier=invariant
NCCL_DMABUF_ENABLE=0    # tier=preset
NCCL_IB_DISABLE=<derived:interconnect.nccl_transport→NCCL_IB_DISABLE>    # tier=env
NCCL_IB_GID_INDEX=<manifest.interconnect.gid_index>    # tier=env
NCCL_IB_HCA=<manifest.interconnect.hca_devices>    # tier=env
NCCL_IB_MERGE_NICS=1    # tier=preset
NCCL_IB_QPS_PER_CONNECTION=4    # tier=preset
NCCL_IB_SPLIT_DATA_ON_QPS=0    # tier=preset
NCCL_NET=<derived:interconnect.nccl_transport→NCCL_NET>    # tier=env
NCCL_NET_GDR_C2C=0    # tier=preset
NCCL_NET_GDR_LEVEL=LOC    # tier=preset
NCCL_NET_GDR_READ=0    # tier=preset
NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME=<derived:interconnect.socket_iface→NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME>    # tier=env
OMPI_MCA_btl_tcp_if_include=<derived:interconnect.socket_iface→OMPI_MCA_btl_tcp_if_include>    # tier=env
TP_SOCKET_IFNAME=<derived:interconnect.socket_iface→TP_SOCKET_IFNAME>    # tier=env
UCX_NET_DEVICES=<derived:interconnect.socket_iface→UCX_NET_DEVICES>    # tier=env
